        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-LGN04036CDR, Back to Back Cedar Laguna 36 Inch Door Pull Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Cedar 36 Inch Back to Back Door Pull Set comes packaged as a pair of pulls and back to back mounting hardware. The Cedar Laguna Pull is 36 inches long and is made out of 1-1/2 Inch diameter Cedar with Stainless Steel standoffs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions LGN04036CDR Laguna Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Cedar </li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Custom Ordered Size. <b>No Returns</b></i>\r\n</p>",
